N5008 [temp.deduct.type]: pack deduction against a full-specialization
instance must use the primary-template-relative argument list (the
specialization's own list is empty).  The instance now records
ID_full_template_args across elaboration and deduction prefers it.
Distilled from std::pair's piecewise constructor probed with
tuple<int&&> inside _Rb_tree emplace.  g++/clang++ runtime-verified.
Note: sizeof...(A1) in the ctor also checks the deduced arity (1).
